  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerin bizi geni\u015F bir tarla g\xF6rseliyle kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131yor.
    Verimlili\u011Finden \u015F\xFCphe duydu\u011Fun bu tarlada her t\xFCrl\xFC hububat\u0131n
    yeti\u015Fmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131na \u015Fahit olacak, bolluk ve berekete
    ula\u015Facaks\u0131n. Bu tarlan\u0131n, sahibi oldu\u011Fun i\u015Fini simgeledi\u011Fini
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. \u015Eu anda gidi\u015Fattan pek memnun olmasan da,
    fal\u0131n bu i\u015Fin b\xFCy\xFCk bir potansiyel ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm kadar\u0131yla {{yil_+1}} y\u0131l\u0131n\u0131n
    \xF6zellikle \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC \xE7eyre\u011Fini a\u015Ft\u0131ktan sonra, i\u015Fine
    dair endi\u015Felerin de azalmaya ba\u015Flayacak. Bedeli ayl\u0131k gelirinin
    {{sayi,2,9}} kat\u0131n\u0131 a\u015Fan bir harcama ya da yat\u0131r\u0131m yapmay\u0131
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsan, bunun i\xE7in en g\xFCzel zaman yine {{yil_+1}} y\u0131l\u0131n\u0131n
    ekim ve kas\u0131m aylar\u0131 olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilmeni isterim."
